Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:50.28,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, she's made it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 她打成了！
