Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.06,0:01:58.42,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Marta knows it, doesn't she?{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N玛尔塔自己也知道 对吧？
