Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.90,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Thirty-fifteen.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N{\fs78}30{\fs68}比{\fs78}15{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.60,0:02:48.10,TL,,0,0,355,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, simply fabulous from Marta Kostyuk.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N噢 科斯秋克打得实在太精彩了！
